Subject: [PATCH] OSCORE Group: verify countersignatures with the credential hash

cose_sign1_verify() passed the COSE signature algorithm (EdDSA, -8) as the
hash algorithm to coap_crypto_hash_verify(), whose get_hash_alg() only knows
SHA-*; every group-mode signature check therefore failed. Use
public_cred->sign_hash, as cose_sign1_sign() does.
---
--- a/src/oscore/oscore_cose.c
+++ b/src/oscore/oscore_cose.c
@@ -636,7 +636,10 @@
                          "Public Cred",
                          ptr->public_cred->pub_der);
   }
-  return coap_crypto_hash_verify(ptr->alg, signature, text, ptr->public_cred);
+  /* As cose_sign1_sign(): the hash of the credential, not the COSE
+   * signature algorithm (e.g. SHA-512, not EdDSA) */
+  return coap_crypto_hash_verify(ptr->public_cred->sign_hash, signature, text,
+                                 ptr->public_cred);
 }
 #endif /* COAP_OSCORE_GROUP_SUPPORT */
 
